  ('5EG5','Gap filling','Complete the sentence: First, fold the paper in half. ___, draw a line along the fold.','[{"id":"a","text":"Next"},{"id":"b","text":"Finally before"},{"id":"c","text":"Because"},{"id":"d","text":"Although"}]'::jsonb,'"a"'::jsonb,'Next introduces the following step.','Read the whole sentence, identify the grammar pattern and then compare all four options.',4),
