  ('5EG7','Gap filling','Complete the sentence: They ___ attention when the teacher asked the question.','[{"id":"a","text":"were not paying"},{"id":"b","text":"was not paying"},{"id":"c","text":"did not paying"},{"id":"d","text":"are not paying"}]'::jsonb,'"a"'::jsonb,'A negative past continuous verb for they uses were not plus -ing.','Read the whole sentence, identify the grammar pattern and then compare all four options.',3),
