  ('5EG7','Gap filling','Complete the sentence: While I ___ to school, I found a key.','[{"id":"a","text":"was walking"},{"id":"b","text":"were walking"},{"id":"c","text":"walked while"},{"id":"d","text":"am walking"}]'::jsonb,'"a"'::jsonb,'The action after while is an ongoing past action.','Read the whole sentence, identify the grammar pattern and then compare all four options.',4),
