  ('5EG7','Gap filling','Complete the sentence: The lights went out while we ___ a film.','[{"id":"a","text":"were watching"},{"id":"b","text":"was watching"},{"id":"c","text":"watched while"},{"id":"d","text":"are watching"}]'::jsonb,'"a"'::jsonb,'Were watching describes the longer action interrupted by a shorter event.','Read the whole sentence, identify the grammar pattern and then compare all four options.',2),
