  ('5EG7','Gap filling','Complete the sentence: I was reading ___ my brother was drawing.','[{"id":"a","text":"while"},{"id":"b","text":"when suddenly after"},{"id":"c","text":"because of"},{"id":"d","text":"until first"}]'::jsonb,'"a"'::jsonb,'While can link two actions happening at the same time.','Read the whole sentence, identify the grammar pattern and then compare all four options.',3),
