  ('5EG7','Gap filling','Complete the sentence: The pupils were lining up ___ the bell rang.','[{"id":"a","text":"when"},{"id":"b","text":"while the same"},{"id":"c","text":"until first"},{"id":"d","text":"although of"}]'::jsonb,'"a"'::jsonb,'When introduces a shorter action interrupting a longer one.','Read the whole sentence, identify the grammar pattern and then compare all four options.',4),
