  ('5EG8','Proofreading','A pupil wrote: “Sara said, “I can swim.” This becomes: Sara told that I can swam.” Which word or phrase should replace “Sara told that I can swam.”?','[{"id":"a","text":"Sara said that her could swim."},{"id":"b","text":"Sara said that she could swim."},{"id":"c","text":"Sara told that I can swam."},{"id":"d","text":"Sara said she can swimming."}]'::jsonb,'"b"'::jsonb,'The correct version is: Sara said, “I can swim.” This becomes: Sara said that she could swim.','Read the whole sentence, identify the grammar pattern and then compare all four options.',3),
