  ('5EG8','Gap filling','Complete the sentence: Which reporting verb is correct? The nurse ___ me to rest.','[{"id":"a","text":"told"},{"id":"b","text":"said"},{"id":"c","text":"said to that"},{"id":"d","text":"told to"}]'::jsonb,'"a"'::jsonb,'Tell is followed by an object; say is not used directly before an object.','Read the whole sentence, identify the grammar pattern and then compare all four options.',4),
