  ('5EG8','Proofreading','A pupil wrote: “Which reporting verb is correct? The nurse said me to rest.” Which word or phrase should replace “said”?','[{"id":"a","text":"told to"},{"id":"b","text":"told"},{"id":"c","text":"said"},{"id":"d","text":"said to that"}]'::jsonb,'"b"'::jsonb,'The correct version is: Which reporting verb is correct? The nurse told me to rest.','Read the whole sentence, identify the grammar pattern and then compare all four options.',3),
