  ('5EG8','Gap filling','Complete the sentence: Yesterday, Ben said that he ___ the film the week before.','[{"id":"a","text":"had watched"},{"id":"b","text":"has watch"},{"id":"c","text":"watches tomorrow"},{"id":"d","text":"is watching now"}]'::jsonb,'"a"'::jsonb,'Had watched shows an action completed before the past reporting time.','Read the whole sentence, identify the grammar pattern and then compare all four options.',3),
